{"id":730,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"For Primarina, every battle’s a stage. Its singing and the dancing of its balloons will mesmerize the audience."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"With its mouth, it makes sonic waves that sound like beautiful singing. It uses the sonic waves to control its water balloons."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Also known as a songstress, it has a fantastical look on moonlit nights when it leads its colony in song."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"To Primarina, every battle is a stage. It takes down its prey with beautiful singing and dancing."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"Its singing voice is its chief weapon in battle. This Pokémon’s Trainer must prioritize the daily maintenance of its throat at all costs."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"It controls its water balloons with song. The melody is learned from others of its kind and is passed down from one generation to the next."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Torrent","hidden":false,"description":"Powers up Water-type moves when the Pokémon's HP is low."},{"name":"Liquid Voice","hidden":true,"description":"Sound-based moves become Water-type moves."}],"eggGroups":["Water 1","Field"],"genderRate":1,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":null,"color":"Blue","shape":"Fish","evolution":{"id":728,"name":"Popplio","condition":null,"children":[{"id":729,"name":"Brionne","condition":"Lv. 17","children":[{"id":730,"name":"Primarina","condition":"Lv. 34","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[0,664],[1,1],[1,45],[1,55],[1,574],[9,453],[12,608],[15,196],[20,47],[25,61],[30,227],[37,581],[44,304],[51,585],[58,56]],"machine":[512,914,133,59,34,347,204,886,605,574,577,227,203,412,263,812,416,114,270,308,56,63,304,58,861,196,113,710,802,581,583,182,244,94,917,240,115,156,247,214,883,500,164,57,129,851,813,253,518,352,127,311,250],"egg":[392,791,195],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me5-88","name":"Primarina","set":"Pitch Black","date":"2026-07-17","rarity